# Preset YAML first

Tunable configuration lives in **`projects/<slug>/config.yaml`**, loaded by `core/preset` (`load_preset`, `Preset`). Global defaults merge from `$PEAKY_HOME/config.yaml`. Reference shape: `peaky_home/projects/sample/config.yaml`.

Use `update_preset_yaml_tree` / `write_preset_document` for writes; `read_preset_yaml_tree` preserves `#` comments.

## Do

- Add tunables to preset YAML and extend `core/preset/model.py` when needed.
- Keep RF, sites, and simulation in the file — reproducible and diffable.

## Avoid

- Hard-coding region-specific site lists or RF constants in Python.
- Duplicating preset fields in CLI flags (serve-only product has minimal CLI).

```python
job = load_preset(job_path)  # core.preset
```
